docs {
  # GET /api/postal-codes/ — List postal-code locations

  Returns paginated `Location` objects where `zone__name="Codigo Postal"`. Requires `Authorization: Token {{token}}`. Source: `travels/views.py:18 PostalCodeViewSet` (note serializer is `ZoneSerializer` — API shape is flat `Location` with `id,name`; bug tracked separately).

  ## Status codes

  - `200 OK` — success
  - `401 Unauthorized` — missing/invalid token (see `_auth/get_unauthenticated.bru`)

  ## Response (200)

  ```json
  {
    "count": 1,
    "next": null,
    "previous": null,
    "results": [
      { "id": 10, "name": "23410" }
    ]
  }
  ```

  Envelope `{count, next, previous, results}` per `core/pagination.py:4`. One item shown.

  ## Error (401)

  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Invalid token.",
    "data": {}
  }
  ```
}
